# ! [allow (unused)] # [derive (Clone , Copy , Debug)] pub struct Vector < T : Clone + Copy > { pub buffer : * mut T , pub len : i32 , pub cap : i32 } impl < T : Clone + Copy > Vector < T > { fn new (capacity : i32) -> Box < Self > { let mut raw_buffer = unsafe { let mut v : Vec < _ > = (0 .. capacity) . map (| _ | std :: mem :: zeroed ()) . collect () ; let p = v . as_mut_ptr () ; std :: mem :: forget (v) ; p } ; let mut v = Box :: new (Vector { buffer : raw_buffer , len : 0i32 , cap : capacity }) ; return v ; } fn push (& mut self , item : T) { if (self . len < self . cap) { unsafe { * self . buffer . add (self . len as usize) = item ; } self . len = (self . len + 1i32) ; } else { println ! ("{:?}" , "vector overflow" . to_string ()) ; } } fn get (& self , index : i32) -> T { return unsafe { * self . buffer . add (index as usize) } ; } } fn main () { let mut vec = Vector :: new (10i32) ; vec . push (42i32) ; vec . push (100i32) ; println ! ("{:?}" , "Item 0:" . to_string ()) ; println ! ("{:?}" , vec . get (0i32)) ; println ! ("{:?}" , "Item 1:" . to_string ()) ; println ! ("{:?}" , vec . get (1i32)) ; }